## Recent Highlights

For the most up-to-date information on new features, bug fixes, and security updates, please check the [latest release](https://github.com/FOSSBilling/FOSSBilling/releases/latest).

## Breaking Changes

When updating FOSSBilling, always review the release notes for any breaking changes that may require manual intervention. Breaking changes are clearly marked in each release.

## Security Updates

Security-related changes are documented in our [Security Advisories](https://github.com/FOSSBilling/FOSSBilling/security/advisories). We recommend subscribing to GitHub security alerts for your FOSSBilling installation.
